{"4605570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Probation Protocol", "steam_appid": 4605570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future where work is mandatory and jobs are nonexistent, you’ve signed a contract with Orion Industrial. Your job is to go into their hazardous, abandoned facilities to perform routine maintenance, recover assets, and restore their failing systems. if you survive the probation period, you get hired full time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are armed with a standard-issue, perfectly working and definitely up to code hazmat suit and whatever else you are foolish enough to bring. You’ll navigate dark, unstable environments where something has clearly gone wrong. But they won't tell you that. If something happens, no one is coming for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/009527a726586eb5ae4e69a1ad3b706f.poster.avif?t=1781858885\" width=828 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/009527a726586eb5ae4e69a1ad3b706f.webm?t=1781858885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/009527a726586eb5ae4e69a1ad3b706f.mp4?t=1781858885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR TABLET IS YOUR LIFELINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tablet has your back. Tracking your vitals, equipment, surroundings, and objectives this little handy device issued by Orion Industrial will help you complete your assigned tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/a8a9ab35a015371c24da432d196761e6.poster.avif?t=1781858885\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/a8a9ab35a015371c24da432d196761e6.webm?t=1781858885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/a8a9ab35a015371c24da432d196761e6.mp4?t=1781858885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE EXPENDABLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company does not care about you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn credits by completing contracts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase tools and supplies to improve your chances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose money when you fail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of credits… and your employment is terminated</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe, just maybe you will make it past probation. Then you will be valued slightly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REMEMBER, THIS IS THE ONLY JOB LEFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clock in and get your tasks, complete your tasks, then make it back alive... Or don’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/094eca8253d0803de2231f4f81589514.poster.avif?t=1781858885\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/094eca8253d0803de2231f4f81589514.webm?t=1781858885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/094eca8253d0803de2231f4f81589514.mp4?t=1781858885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s always someone else waiting to take your place. Welcome to Orion Industrial!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Solo extraction gameplay. Take on high-risk contracts alone in a singleplayer FPS extraction loop where every run is a calculated risk. Complete objectives and extract safely... or lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Persistent risk and economy. Earn credits from successful extractions and spend them on tools and supplies. Fail a mission, and the company deducts your losses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hostile, unstable environments. Explore abandoned corporate facilities filled with environmental hazards, limited visibility, and something still lurking inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-And much, much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future where work is mandatory and jobs are nonexistent, you’ve signed a contract with Orion Industrial. Your job is to go into their hazardous, abandoned facilities to perform routine maintenance, recover assets, and restore their failing systems. if you survive the probation period, you get hired full time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are armed with a standard-issue, perfectly working and definitely up to code hazmat suit and whatever else you are foolish enough to bring. You’ll navigate dark, unstable environments where something has clearly gone wrong. But they won't tell you that. If something happens, no one is coming for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_i