edits… and your employment is terminated</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe, just maybe you will make it past probation. Then you will be valued slightly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REMEMBER, THIS IS THE ONLY JOB LEFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clock in and get your tasks, complete your tasks, then make it back alive... Or don’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/094eca8253d0803de2231f4f81589514.poster.avif?t=1781858885\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/094eca8253d0803de2231f4f81589514.webm?t=1781858885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4605570/extras/094eca8253d0803de2231f4f81589514.mp4?t=1781858885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s always someone else waiting to take your place. Welcome to Orion Industrial!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Solo extraction gameplay. Take on high-risk contracts alone in a singleplayer FPS extraction loop where every run is a calculated risk. Complete objectives and extract safely... or lose everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Persistent risk and economy. Earn credits from successful extractions and spend them on tools and supplies. Fail a mission, and the company deducts your losses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hostile, unstable environments. Explore abandoned corporate facilities filled with environmental hazards, limited visibility, and something still lurking inside.</p><p class=\"bb_para